<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Physical_and_Theoretical_Chemistry_Textbook_Maps/Electron_Paramagnetic_Resonance_(Jenschke)/01:_Introduction/1.03:_images" class="mt-section" id="section_13"><span id="10.2.1._The_magnetic_moment_of_the_free_electron"></span><h4 count_line="1" data_line="267,268" data_line_end="267" data_line_start="267" id="the-magnetic-moment-of-the-free-electron" type="subsubsection" class="lt-chem-370953 editable">10.2.1. The magnetic moment of the free electron</h4>



